The output baud rate is correct (9600) and that should give me (at least) some garbage when I try to send data to the printer.

What usually happens looks something like this:

#
# lp Test.Substances
request id is 2
# ps -ax | grep lpd
 307 ?     Ss   0:00.02 /usr/sbin/lpd -s
2298 ?     I    0:00.01 /usr/sbin/lpd -s
#
#

